00:24:02.245 --> 00:24:07.400
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Now I know that sounds like the snarky

00:24:07.400 --> 00:24:14.460
wife comment, maybe it is a snarky wife
comment, I kind of took a sober look at

00:24:14.460 --> 00:24:20.160
that book, once I kind of was clear from
