I'm not quite sure why.

00:25:21.220 --> 00:25:29.510
Anyway, so it's just my name
Barnett Talks, because I do.

00:25:29.510 --> 00:25:32.000
And then all my teaching
notes are on there.

00:25:32.000 --> 00:25:37.140
If you like it spoon fed,
